<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not well tested-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not well tested-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Monday's close, USDA said. Carcass basis heifers not well tested with steers not tested.</p>
<p>Heifers:  Mostly Choice 2-4 1150 lbs ld 103.50.</p>
<p>Reported sales for Tues: 100    Week to Date:  3,200</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-872))</p>
